der as beloved as Perseus. When he asks whether Halia still needs the protection of a fallen god, you tell him that humanity's fate should rest in its own hands.","jp":"アバルドは、あなたの協力に深く感謝した。そしていつの日か、ペルセウスのように人々に慕われる指導者になりたいと言った。「ホーリンには神の庇護が必要なのか」と尋ねたアバルドに、あなたは「人間の運命は自らの手で切り開くべきだ」と答えた。","kr":"나의 도움에 깊이 감사한 아반드는 언젠가 페르세우스처럼 존경받는 영주가 되고 싶다고 말했다. 아반드는 나에게 보칼리스인에게 타락한 신의 가호가 필요할지 물어봤고, 나는 인간의 운명은 스스로 개척해야 한다고 말했다."},"context_summary_status":{"cn":"aligned_plot_summary","en":"aligned_plot_summary","jp":"aligned_plot_summary","kr":"aligned_plot_summary"},"context_summary_record_index":25433,"context_summary_record_indices":[25433],"context_summary_match_status":"aligned_exact_unique","context_summary_source_asset_key":"timeline/timeline_story_1501021170","context_summary_direction":"next_plot_summary","context_summary_distance":13,"exploration_line_id":"15010226","exploration_collection_key":"season_5","exploration_chapter_key":"season_5","exploration_story_kind":"side_quest","quest_title_i18n":{"cn":"解除精神之楔","en":"Remove the Wedge","jp":"精神の楔を解除する","kr":"정신의 큐브 해제하기"},"quest_title_status":"exact_duplicate_same","quest_title_record_index":"53366","quest_summary_i18n":{"cn":"你们通过考验，解除了精神之楔的封印。","en":"You passed the trial and removed the seal of the Wedge of Spirit.","jp":"あなたたちは試練を乗り越え、精神の楔の封印を解除した。","kr":"시험에 통과해, 정신의 큐브의 봉인을 해제했다."},"quest_summary_status":"exact_unique","quest_summary_record_index":"42517","exploration_evidence_source":"ExplStep.FinishAction.C_RunPlot","exploration_placement_note":"","sequence_index":427,"previous_story_asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15201210","next_story_asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15201220","objective_key":"15010226:1:2","objective_task_id":"1","objective_step_id":"2","objective_title_source_cn":"探索精神领域","objective_title_i18n":{"cn":"探索精神领域","en":"Explore the Realm","jp":"精神の領域を探索する","kr":"정신의 영역 탐색하기"},"objective_title_status":"exact_unique","objective_title_record_index":"53368","objective_summary_source_cn":"探索精神之楔的领域，寻找封印。","objective_s